</style></head><body><main class="container"><h1>${esc(heading)}</h1><p>${esc(explanation)}</p><section><h2>Run summary</h2><p>${esc(counts.feed || 0)} feed item(s), ${esc(counts.distinct || 0)} distinct, ${esc(counts.new || 0)} new, ${esc(counts.rejected || 0)} rejected, ${esc(counts.held || 0)} held for verification, ${esc(counts.failed || 0)} failed.</p></section>${databaseSection}${heldSection}${failureSection}${ingestSection}${reasonSection}</main></body></html>`;

